        "changeLog": ""
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.1.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.1.0",
        "fileName": "wotsubtitles.syncbridge_1.1.0.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T15:38:39.391Z",
        "changeLog": "Version 1.1.0 — Babylon: Dark Tower\n\n- Adds Babylon event subtitle content and four portraits made for SyncBridge.\n- Uses the approved Babylon portrait framing and the shared battle/preview scale.\n- Activates a validated Babylon resource without waiting for unrelated profiles to finish checking.\n- In Automatic duration mode, ends Babylon captions when their uniquely associated native voice ends and discards already-ended captions. Explicit duration choices retain their configured behavior.\n- Adds the event option to hide ordinary captions while spectating after elimination, preserving player-death lines and restoring normal presentation after respawn.\n- Retains existing GuP compatibility. Subtitles for new GuP members are not included.\n- Quick access via Ctrl + F6; works in battles\nNo game audio or original game portraits are bundled. "
      }
    },
